Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 16:14:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] fix(rfork): adapt v0.26.0rc1 APIs

Resolve hardware profiles lazily for both the RFork loader and compatibility fingerprint generation while preserving the legacy 310P layout fallback.

Use the v0.26 location of AscendUnquantizedFusedMoEMethod and keep focused compatibility coverage for native and legacy hardware profile resolution.

Signed-off-by: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
